Bottom fade, ~20–24 px ramp. In the Transaction pane it works: a legible half-line dissolves mid-sentence (7.34:1 at y=858, 4.17 at 876, 2.05 at 884). In the Code pane it does not — the ramp is shorter than one 23 px code row, so line 52 survives only as an 8 px smudge at 1.53:1, which reads as a cut. Give Code ≥36 px.

Top fixes: tighten row pitch (26 code lines in 687 px); hoist the repeated module path out of the Call Trace rows.

